{"server":"tw","storyId":"act34side_level_act34side_03_end","groupId":"act34side","stageId":"act34side_03","title":"如海雪紛散","storyCode":"BP-3","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act34side/level_act34side_03_end.txt","sourceHash":"d4d97a07a2a62b70a028a4a03cac8cc2ea6bac83ac29fae19a3614d1e02442fa","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g6_aegirarena"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬迪，原來你還在這裡。其他人都已經離開了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我不知道今天會有一場評議會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，這些檢索記錄……你提了很多問題。“海洋究竟有多遼闊，如果它比陸地大的話，大多少？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“阿戈爾的城市就一直待在海底嗎，它可不可以升到海面上去？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“海底沒有日夜，阿戈爾人如何區分日夜？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喬迪，你試圖透過這樣的方式來理解阿戈爾嗎？我擔心這只會徒增你的困惑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿維圖斯先生，其實，我覺得很激動，卻不知道為什麼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看過審判庭繪製的海圖，離開海岸線幾海里，就只剩下了代表未知的藍灰色空白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"甚至在一些條件極度惡劣的地區，我們連海岸線都無法接近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可在你們的海圖上，每一個角落都有那麼多訊息。地質、能源、生態，我甚至點不完那些無窮無盡的頁面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大洋腹地的森林、永恆不化的冰山、海溝深處的熱泉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就在剛剛，有那麼一個瞬間，我覺得大地、天空、海洋，都觸手可及。這世間的一切都是為我而準備的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，真是狂妄至極的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，年輕人。這只是一種對於世界最質樸的嚮往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可我……"},{"type":"narration","text":"年輕的阿戈爾人抬起頭，呆呆望著眼前的珊瑚狀終端。流動著符號的全息影像在他的臉龐上躍動，點亮那雙柔軟的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿維圖斯先生，我來到這座城市已經一天多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我學不會使用你們的科技，聽不懂你們在討論的話題，甚至連方向都搞不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛那場評議會……我也理解不了你們解決爭議的方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我剛剛搜尋了船舶設計師布雷奧甘——我曾以為他是我的先人。我看到了他的相貌，聽到了他的錄音，見到了他做過的設計……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"影像裡的那個人真的和我有任何相似之處嗎？他的後裔……真的會是我這個樣子嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、我找不到自己屬於這裡的痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“阿戈爾”就像一座高大而醒目的燈塔，我一直都知道它，可等到我終於看見了它的光亮，走到塔下……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卻反而什麼都看不清了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g6_aegirarena"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“布雷奧甘”，我有多久未曾聽人提起這個名字了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布雷奧甘在阿戈爾也算得上是位奇人。他曾是技術院最有天賦的設計師，卻在阿戈爾最需要他的時候，拋棄了一切前往陸地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，這座城市和布雷奧甘還有些緣分，儘管這緣分有些，微妙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"微妙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年，布雷奧甘便是從這座城市前往的陸地，聽說幾位執政官還因為沒能將他留下，險些受到了發展規劃所的問責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，喬迪，我不能斷言你與他是否存在血緣上的聯繫，但這種聯繫本身並不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是一名阿戈爾人，這是不言自明的事實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我懂，我是阿戈爾人，可如果連先人的血脈也無法追溯，我又該如何證明自己屬於這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不需要證明自己的歸屬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我能理解你。我們都希望能從過往找到答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自豪地說，我是整個阿戈爾最為優秀的先史研究者之一，我相信歷史的重量，歷史蘊藏著真相與規律，它能告訴我們該往何處去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿維圖斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1386_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲）可如果歷史告訴我，我們的家園和文明注定毀滅呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_npc_1380_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……您剛剛說什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g4_aegirstreet_1"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"斯卡蒂，你還好嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你剛剛說了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉。我只是在想鯊魚和劍魚的情況。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"她們大概正在屠殺海裡的弱小生物吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"她們大概在擔心斯卡蒂現在怎麼樣了。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"打起精神來，斯卡蒂。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不擔心她們，她們很強。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"以前沒來到羅德島的時候，我因為總會給身邊的人帶來災禍，一直是孤身一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到，現在又要經歷這樣的狀況。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我在。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你怕自己會給歌蕾蒂婭她們帶來災禍？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"也許吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"不過之前，獵人們並不怕連累彼此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都背負著同樣的厄運，所以我們並肩作戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"但這一次，我想，我大概不只會牽連獵人們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我可能會將整個阿戈爾捲入災難。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不會的，斯卡蒂。我相信你。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長之前也總是這麼說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"交代作戰方案的時候，他對別人都交代得很詳細，但對我，他只會說他相信我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"……他相信我即使記不下那些複雜的戰術原理與策略，也能完成任務。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那你相信他嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長一直都很可靠，也有很多辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"他每次出戰前作的那些曲子我都還記得。他說因為海嗣不懂得音樂，所以曲子可以用作訊號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我覺得那些曲子都很好聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"他的方向感好得出奇，我們在迷宮般的巢穴中紛紛偏航的時候，他總能一個一個把我們帶回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我們總能放心地仰賴他指引方向，直到……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"直到最後的那場戰鬥？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。那場戰鬥，一隊與四隊的獵人們用生命打開了一條通路，二隊截住了回湧的海嗣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長衝在最前面，他很快到達了指定位置，“初生”的核心器官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"緊接著，我們失去了他的訊號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為他犧牲了。那麼我該揮出那至關重要的一劍。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"但他沒有犧牲。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。我不知道那天具體發生了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我其實也不知道現在他為什麼沒有回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"越是不知道，我越覺得自己該做些什麼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"相信自己，斯卡蒂，你有一名戰士的直覺。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"記得嗎，呯呯，咚，啪？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"呵——呯呯，咚，啪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我記住了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g12_seabed"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到達坐標位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的速度已經足夠快……但似乎還是遲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡已經變成了一個巨大的掩埋場。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g12_seabed"},{"type":"narration","text":"龐大的艦船殘骸與海嗣屍骨交織在一起，在它們的映襯下，海水中飄蕩的殘餘物像是紛飛的雪片。\n人們有時候會稱之為“海雪”，但這樣美麗的名字並不能掩蓋它的實質——那是生物組織的碎片，既有海嗣的，也有人類的。\n腥甜的味道被艦炮殘留的餘熱蒸騰，與雪片一同在海中紛散。\n深海獵人靈敏的嗅覺放大了每一種氣味，幽靈鯊捂住了鼻子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g12_seabed"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鯊魚，你不應該對眼前的場景感到陌生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軍團艦隊以數量牽制住海嗣群體，深海獵人藉機繞過正面戰場，斬殺海嗣群體的核心，這是我們最為熟悉的戰術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"獵人們每一次從海嗣的巢穴離開，見到的都是這樣的畫面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在陸地上待了太久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回想起來的感覺真不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一艘工程母艦，十餘艘戰列艦，還有更多的小型艦船……從殘骸扎進海床的位置來看，艦隊一直保持陣型，並非完全沒有準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"附近的岩石有被重力發生裝置破壞的痕跡。他們在遭遇襲擊後第一時間嘗試布設人造力場，製造真空斷層來阻擋海嗣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但海嗣比他們更快，艦隊甚至沒來得及組成交叉火力網。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們和海嗣短兵相接……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艦隊的目的地是第三十七號巢穴，但從現場的情況來看，所有艦船的行進方向卻是彌利亞留姆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，既然艦隊已經全軍覆沒，海嗣為什麼沒有下一步的動作？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劍魚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔————"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，抓住我的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過，你應該乖乖待在巡邏艦上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深潛裝置只能幫助我們不被海水的重壓擠成碎片，哪怕是阿戈爾人，沒受過系統訓練，也會像你這樣被海流沖得東倒西歪……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想笑就趕緊笑，笑完了趕快幫我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣吧，你想像一下自己是在對付一個極其難纏的舞伴，反制她，找到平衡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很輕，這對你來說應該不難。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……別看我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就先往前了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"燈光陣列的殘骸……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斷裂的金屬支杆上還殘留著少量沒有被海流捲走的組織碎片……人類的，還有，海嗣的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"檢測結果與發展規劃所提供的樣本相匹配——是圖利婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是彌利亞留姆在四十個小時前的停泊點，根據燈光陣列的位置來看，她當時是從城市邊緣循環系統的排污口進入了海洋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……她為什麼要離開城市？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很難從現場的情況推導出當時的情形，海流沖走了大部分的有效訊息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圖利婭是否是對航道計劃心懷怨恨的深海教徒，又究竟經歷了什麼……我們很難從這裡得到答案了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡距離彌利亞留姆現在的停泊點有兩個小時的航程，哪怕她身上有深潛裝置……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不可能游回城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而根據現場殘留的組織碎片來看，她似乎還遭遇了海嗣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圖利婭不可能活下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"線索斷了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是……深海獵人們出發的方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰況或許比想像中還要激烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"航道計劃已經順利推進到最後階段，等到第三十七號巢穴的定位完成，我們便可以徹底驅除整片海域的海嗣，開啟航道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偏偏在這最關鍵的時機上……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圖利婭的事情會不會與艦隊遇襲有關？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又或者，圍繞著她發生的所有事情，都只是有人為了轉移海巡隊的注意力而故布疑陣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"突然出現的變數太多，眼前的一切都像是被亂流所裹挾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西昆妲","speakerId":"avg_4137_udflow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……先返回城市吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"51_g10_shipinterior"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傾斜，加速！繞過前面那道山脊，再斜向折返，應該可以甩掉三分之一的追兵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"指揮官，海嗣已經侵入了船艙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它們破壞了氣密層！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"領航員，船艙裡的這些交給我們，你只需要負責繼續玩好這場捉迷藏！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……可是，仿海嗣塗層只剩下百分之十仍在生效，艦船很快就會完全暴露在它們的視野下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盡最大可能爭取時間，能拖多久是多久！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_1388_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咕——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鯊魚，其他的交給你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"深海獵人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歌蕾蒂婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我認識您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"執政官閣下，其他的艦船已經安全返回了彌利亞留姆嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——幸好，幸好……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在保存下來盡可能多的有生力量，就能在之後發揮更大的作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是這艘船的指揮官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們遭遇了伏擊。大批的海嗣離開了巢穴，出現在了艦隊行進的途中……在此前的信標投放任務中，極少出現類似的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不能暴露作戰部署，艦隊應該撤離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們駕駛著艦隊機動性最高的艦船，由我們留下來拖住海嗣，掩護主力艦隊撤離，是最合理的戰術安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們還剩多少人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十六人……不到十分之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"執政官閣下，您為何一直在沉默？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，指揮官。這艘船是艦隊唯一倖存的艦船，你們這二十六人，是最後的倖存者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闖進船艙的海嗣都清理乾淨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……你們掩護的那一千多人，在撤退的途中遭遇了規模更大的伏擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我與歌蕾蒂婭趕到附近的山脊時，正好看到這艘船千方百計地在各種複雜的地形裡穿梭……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣完成了對你們的包圍，這艘船只是在包圍圈裡滑稽地打轉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1398_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我們沒有完成作戰任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿戈爾軍官","speakerId":"avg_npc_1399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反而是我們活了下來，犧牲比我們想像的要重，重很多……我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們活了下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打起精神，阿戈爾人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們一樣是阿戈爾最精銳的有生力量，你們一樣可以在之後的作戰中發揮更大的作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和勞倫緹娜會帶你們回到城市。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
